with no session in R. \code{vignette("rewriting-as-tools")} walks through it.

The steps are also available separately: \code{\link[=parse_shiny_app]{parse_shiny_app()}} reads the
code, \code{\link[=analyze_reactive_graph]{analyze_reactive_graph()}} groups it into tools, and
